    {
      "formula_id": "math:divergence-conversion-entire-multi-index-proof:010",
      "source_latex": "\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\int_\\Omega L(\\bm{x},D)u\\,\\phi\\,\\mathrm{d}\\bm{x}\n&=\\sum_{|\\alpha|\\leq2k}\\int_\\Omega(D^\\alpha u)a_\\alpha\\phi\\,\\mathrm{d}\\bm{x}\\\\\n&=\\sum_{|\\alpha|\\leq2k}\\int_\\Omega(D^{\\sigma_\\alpha+\\gamma_\\alpha}u)a_{(\\sigma_\\alpha+\\gamma_\\alpha)}\\phi\\,\\mathrm{d}\\bm{x}\\\\\n&=\\sum_{|\\alpha|\\leq2k}(-1)^{|\\sigma_\\alpha|}\\int_\\Omega(D^{\\gamma_\\alpha}u)\\bigl(D^{\\sigma_\\alpha}[a_{(\\sigma_\\alpha+\\gamma_\\alpha)}\\phi]\\bigr)\\,\\mathrm{d}\\bm{x}\\\\\n&=\\sum_{|\\alpha|\\leq2k}(-1)^{|\\sigma_\\alpha|}\\int_\\Omega D^{\\gamma_\\alpha}u\n\\sum_{\\rho\\leq\\sigma_\\alpha}\\binom{\\sigma_\\alpha}{\\rho}D^{\\sigma_\\alpha-\\rho}a_{(\\sigma_\\alpha+\\gamma_\\alpha)}D^\\rho\\phi\\,\\mathrm{d}\\bm{x}\\\\\n&=\\sum_{\\substack{|\\alpha|\\leq2k\\\\\\rho\\leq\\sigma_\\alpha}}(-1)^{|\\sigma_\\alpha|+|\\rho|}\\int_\\Omega\nD^\\rho\\left[\\binom{\\sigma_\\alpha}{\\rho}D^{\\sigma_\\alpha-\\rho}a_{(\\sigma_\\alpha+\\gamma_\\alpha)}D^{\\gamma_\\alpha}u\\right]\\phi\\,\\mathrm{d}\\bm{x}\\\\\n&=: \\sum_{0\\leq|\\sigma|,|\\gamma|\\leq k}\\int_\\Omega(-1)^{|\\sigma|}D^\\sigma(a_{\\sigma\\gamma}(\\bm{x})D^\\gamma u)\\phi\\,\\mathrm{d}\\bm{x}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]",
